  "details": "no im not talking about the current way to merge accounts i mean to combine 2 vrc accounts into one like there would be a main and a secondary. the secondary's account data would be merged with the main account transferring the age of that account as well as badges and trust rank with the ability to chose what friends, uploaded avatars and worlds to transfer to the main account after the transfer is complete the secondary account will be deleted with the new main account having everything the secondary account had. adding a bit more info i feel is needed. if the secondary account is older then the new main account the the secondary's account age will transfer making the new main account that old like if the main account was only 1 year old and the secondary account was 5 years old the transfer will make the main account 5 years old sorry if i over complicated it",
